efits__title\">Frete grátis</span>\n        <span class=\"na-benefits__sub\">a partir de R$299 (Sul e Sudeste) e R$399 (demais regiões).</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"na-benefits__sep\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"na-benefits__item\">\n      <svg class=\"na-benefits__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"22\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"/><line x1=\"1\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"10\"/></svg>\n      <div class=\"na-benefits__text\">\n        <span class=\"na-benefits__title\">Pagamento Facilitado</span>\n        <span class=\"na-benefits__sub\">Em até 6x sem juros</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"na-benefits__sep\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"na-benefits__item\">\n      <svg class=\"na-benefits__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M9 9h.01M15 9h.01\"/><path d=\"M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"5\"/><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"19\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"22\"/></svg>\n      <div class=\"na-benefits__text\">\n        <span class=\"na-benefits__title\">5% de Desconto</span>\n        <span class=\"na-benefits__sub\">Pagamento via Pix</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"na-benefits__sep\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"na-benefits__item\">\n      <svg class=\"na-benefits__icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polyline points=\"1 4 1 10 7 10\"/><polyline points=\"23 20 23 14 17 14\"/><path d=\"M20.49 9A9 9 0 0 0 5.64 5.64L1 10m22 4l-4.64 4.36A9 9 0 0 1 3.51 15\"/></svg>\n      <div class=\"na-benefits__text\">\n        <span class=\"na-benefits__title\">Troca em até 30 dias.</span>\n        <span class=\"na-benefits__sub\">Primeira troca grátis.<