        "custom_liquid": "<section class=\"na-about\">\n<style>\n  .na-about {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: row;\n    min-height: 90vh;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n  }\n  .na-about__left {\n    flex: 0 0 55%;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: flex-end;\n    padding: 80px 80px 80px 60px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .na-about__label {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #111;\n    margin: 0 0 20px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  }\n  .na-about__text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.65;\n    margin: 0 0 36px;\n    max-width: 520px;\n  }\n  .na-about__text p { margin: 0 0 16px; }\n  .na-about__text p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n  .na-about__btn {\n    display: inline-block;\n    padding: 16px 32px;\n    background: #111111;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    border-radius: 100px;\n    transition: opacity 0.2s;\n    width: fit-content;\n  }\n  .na-about__btn:hover { opacity: 0.8; color: #ffffff; }\n\n  .na-about__right {\n    flex: 0 0 45%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    background: #f4f4f2;\n    padding: 60px 40px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .na-about__img-wrap {\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 380px;\n    border-radius: 20px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    aspect-ratio: 4/5;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  .na-about__img-wrap img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    object-position: center top;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .na-about {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      min-height: auto;\n    }\n    .na-about__left {\n      flex: none;\n      order: 2;\n      padding: 36px 24px 56px;\n      justify-content: flex-start;\n    }\n    .na-about__right {\n      flex: none;\n      order: 1;\n      padding: 40px 24px;\n    }\n    .na-about__img-wrap {\n      max-width: 100%;\n      aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n      border-radius: 16px;\n    }\n    .na-about__img-wrap img {\n      object-position: center center;\n    }\n    .na-about__text { font-size: 14px; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"na-about__left\">\n  <p class=\"na-about__label\">Quem somos</p>\n  <div class=\"na-about__text\">\n    <p>A Natural Art nasceu em 1971 da paixão pelo surf e pela busca constante por evolução dentro e fora da água.</p>\n    <p>Construída entre as ondas da Califórnia, do Havaí e do litoral brasileiro, a marca tornou-se referência em pranchas, equipamentos e lifestyle surfwear, conquistando espaço em mais de 20 países ao redor do mundo.</p>\n    <p>Desde 1983 no Brasil, seguimos desenvolvendo produtos inspirados pela liberdade do litoral, pela conexão com a natureza e pela cultura que faz do surf muito mais do que um esporte: um estilo de vida.</p>\n    <p><strong>Natural Art — Desde 1971.</strong><br>Inspirada pela liberdade do litoral.</p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://naturalart.com.br/nossa-historia/\" class=\"na-about__btn\">Saiba mais</a>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"na-about__right\">\n  <div class=\"na-about__img-wrap\">\n    <img\n      src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0961/5084/7803/files/loja-natural-front-webp-rapido.webp?v=1791484902&width=500\"\n      alt=\"Loja Natural Art\"\n      loading=\"lazy\"\n    >\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</section>",
